    @* === Backup / GPX exchange =============================
       Helm-flagged: import/export GPX used to live in the Layers
       panel on the map, where it took up vertical space alongside
       layer toggles and was a confusing fit ("why is import next
       to OpenSeaMap?"). Settings is the right home for "data in /
       data out" actions. Imports route through the same RouteApi /
       WaypointApi that the map uses, so a freshly-imported GPX
       shows on the map the next time the helm visits it (no live
       re-render -- import is rare, the next-visit fetch is cheap). *@
    <div class="col-12 mt-3">
